===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# One who disclaims, disowns, or renounces.
# A public disavowal, as of pretensions, claims, opinions, and the like.
# {{context|legal|lang=en}} A denial, disavowal, or renunciation, as of a title, claim, interest, estate, or trust; relinquishment or waiver of an interest or estate.

